# Formspree form ID. Create a form at https://formspree.io with the club
# Gmail, then copy the ID from the endpoint URL (formspree.io/f/<THIS>).
#
# Safe to expose: NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars are baked into the client bundle, and a
# Formspree form ID is public by design — it is the POST target of a form on
# a public page. Spam control is Formspree's honeypot + their filtering.
#
# If unset, the contact and volunteer forms fall back to a mailto: link
# rather than silently discarding submissions.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
